Subject: [PATCH] media: qcom: port the reference X1P42100 CAMSS pipeline

Derived by three-way reconciliation of the exact tested aggregate against v7.3.
Original vendor sources and metadata remain in kernel/patches/vendor/mias.
No new author identity or DCO sign-off is asserted. Hardware capture unproven.

